  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reduce the burden of TB in Malawi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program gives support to the only TB patient organisation in the country, Paradiso TB patient trust. Paradiso and their volunteers (former TB patients) work to create awareness on TB and HIV/TB, they help find more cases of TB and support them through treatment and also after treatment completion. The program outcome is that the rights and needs of people affected by TB are met. The project focusses on the rights and needs of men, women and children affected by TB through a gender sensitive and rights based approach. TB and gender analysis are undertaken and actions adjusted according.</narrative>
  </description>
